Troubleshoot electrical system issues and implement corrective actions during commissioning.
Coordinate with engineering, construction, operations, vendors, and OEMs to meet electrical system readiness and performance requirements.
Track system progress and provide clear status updates to commissioning and project leadership.
Maintain accurate commissioning documentation, including electrical checklists, test records, redlines, and turnover packages.#LI-TJ1
